    "catalogue_description": "This will be a remake of the Death Room map from the Free-to-Play Multiplayer game, Combat Arms. There isn\u2019t really any story involved, it\u2019s just a remake of that map into a zombies version. It is a very small and symmetrical map. Features: \u2013 Solo Black Ops style quick revive (if that even matters to you) \u2013 No Dogs \u2013 4 Original Perks from WaW with PaP \u2013 Buyable Ending \u2013 All zombies are risers \u2013 Custom Menu screens \u2013 All COD 4 Guns except M14, USP and Launchers (All PAP-able! ) \u2013 Removed all WaW weapons except Ray Gun, Monkey Bombs, Molotovs and Wunderwaffe \u2013 Increased no. of risers and they will either be runners or sprinters",
